b3190bEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-f9ceb5d8c562840fEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_Cazador'sPalace_ProvenderLedger</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Cazador%27sPalace_ProvenderLedger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_Cazador%27sPalace_ProvenderLedger\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">73b5ee4b-05f3-407e-b3d2-2af4640309e1</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:73b5ee4b-05f3-407e-b3d2-2af4640309e1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:73b5ee4b-05f3-407e-b3d2-2af4640309e1\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Desk\" title=\"Wooden Desk\">Wooden Desk</a> on the top floor of the <a href=\"/wiki/Szarr_Palace\" title=\"Szarr Palace\">Szarr Palace</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1243&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;978</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A ledger listing and tracking inventory of goods in regular use at the Szarr Palace, with categories for food and drink for servants and 'guests'; cleaning supplies, including alchemical bloodstain remover from <a href=\"/wiki/Bonecloak%27s_Apothecary\" title=\"Bonecloak's Apothecary\">Bonecloaks'</a>; opaque heavy curtains; candles of different sizes in yellow tallow and red and black wax; leather straps with buckles; balms and oils; and regular deliveries of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Baldur's Mouth</a> broadsheets.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714220338\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1346/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24795/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6610/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935779/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.607      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   51.607      1 -total\n 37.82%   19.520      6 Template:Icon_text\n 33.49%   17.283     15 Template:Trim\n 24.53%   12.661      1 Template:PageSeo\n 24.30%   12.540      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 18.40%    9.498      1 Template:Main_only\n 18.17%    9.378      2 Template:Uid\n 10.62%    5.483      2 Template:Template_style\n  7.56%    3.902      1 Template:Books\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:19250-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714220338 and revision id 374060. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}